# Hindering Light: the spell must target "you or a permanent you control". Bot2's Lightning Bolt is aimed at Bot2's own
# Ornithopter, which Bot1 does not control: the Light cannot be cast on it (the refusal, naming the Bolt; the positive control
# is hindering-light-counters-a-spell-aimed-at-a-permanent-its-controller-controls). The Bolt resolves and kills the Ornithopter.

